OL,5,G0600 The Aberystwyth Book Club         
OL,6,     FIn this festive special, our group
OL,7,     Fof book lovers discuss Sharp as   
OL,8,     FAny Thorn, a cosy crime novel set 
OL,9,     Fin 1950s Aberystwyth by Sue       
OL,10,     FMcCormick. Did our readers solve  
OL,11,     Fthe mystery?                      
